Use your image generation tool to create exactly ONE image: a square 1024x1024 sprite sheet of tiny glowing warm golden dust motes of varied brightness, sparsely and evenly scattered over a pure flat black background (#000000), well separated, nothing else. It must tile seamlessly. No text, no frame, no other colors in the background. Save the generated image into the current directory as p-dust.png (copy it from wherever the tool writes it, do not resize or edit it). Print only the saved path. Do nothing else.
